Voice Agent Terminal reuses and adapts code from
https://github.com/tf4fun/voice-memo and its FoloToy/ai-passport lineage.

The mDNS publisher, SQLite lifecycle, bounded event fan-out, service startup and
shutdown patterns, and Linux build script are derived from that MIT-licensed
project. The original copyright and permission notice are retained in LICENSE.

The AI Passport board support, terminal UI helpers, Chinese font integration,
settings, Wi-Fi/BLUFI lifecycle and button/idle policies are adapted from the
same voice-memo project. Font licenses and provenance accompany firmware/assets/fonts.

firmware/tests/vendor/cjson contains cJSON source from the ESP-IDF v5.5.3
components/json/cJSON checkout for host protocol tests. Its MIT copyright and
license are retained alongside the sources. Firmware uses ESP-IDF's cJSON component.
